        "book": "1 Nephi",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And he spake also concerning a prophet who should come before the Messiah, to prepare the way of the Lord—",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 38,
            "text": "1 Ne. 11:27; 2 Ne. 31:4 (4–18). TG Foreordination."
          }
